Scenario: Instructor successfully opens a session
  Given the instructor is logged in
  And no session is currently active
  When the instructor opens an office-hours session
  Then the session status becomes Open
  And students can join the queue

Scenario: Instructor attempts to open a duplicate session
  Given the instructor already has an open session
  When the instructor attempts to open another session
  Then the system prevents the duplicate session

Scenario: Instructor closes an active session
  Given an office-hours session is open
  When the instructor closes the session
  Then the session status becomes Closed
  And students cannot join the queue

Scenario: Instructor attempts to close an inactive session
  Given there is no active session
  When the instructor attempts to close a session
  Then the system displays an appropriate error

  Scenario: Student successfully joins
  Given an office-hours session is open
  And the student is not already in the queue
  When the student submits a topic and joins
  Then the student is added to the queue
  And the student receives a queue position

Scenario: Student attempts to join a closed queue
  Given an office-hours session is closed
  When the student attempts to join
  Then the system rejects the request

  Scenario: Student attempts to join twice
  Given the student already has a place in an open queue
  When the student attempts to join again
  Then the system rejects the second entry
  And the original queue position is preserved

Scenario: Student joins after completing a previous request
  Given the student has completed their previous request
  And the office-hours session is still open
  When the student attempts to join again
  Then the system evaluates the request as a new entry

  Scenario: Calculate waiting time
  Given the student's queue position is 3
  And the average service time is 5 minutes
  When the system calculates the estimated waiting time
  Then the estimated waiting time is 15 minutes

Scenario: Student is first in the queue
  Given the student's queue position is 1
  And the average service time is 5 minutes
  When the system calculates the estimated waiting time
  Then the estimated waiting time is 5 minutes

  Scenario: Instructor calls the next student
  Given there are students waiting in the queue
  When the instructor selects Call Next
  Then the first waiting student becomes Called
  And the student is notified of their status

Scenario: Instructor calls next when queue is empty
  Given there are no students waiting
  When the instructor selects Call Next
  Then the system indicates that the queue is empty
